        },
        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya ũndũ wa athani ala mavĩtĩthasya andũ makwa; ala maũmaa na maeo moo, na kwaasya, Mũuo; na o ũla ũtekwĩkĩa kĩndũ makanyw’anĩ moo, no makwatasya kaũ nake: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
