              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩw’ai ũũ, nĩngũmwĩsũva, inyw’ĩ atongoi ma nyũmba ya Yakovo, na asumbĩki ma nyũmba ya Isilaeli, ala mũthĩthaa ũsili wa katĩ, na kwelelũkasya ũlũngalu w’onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
